      "source_sha256": "5b1831f6cfc6bc37623de2b49b9947f71a39f5e0e91f868edb797a5092513a9f",
      "target": "# 使用 HTN 与演化搜索进行规划\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "6ce077ce69213b9f6fdec28880012358df78cb8ecc534a061abbbe02e4f71177",
      "target": "> 符号规划（symbolic planning）适用于计划（plan）可证明正确（provably correct）的场景。演化代码搜索（evolutionary code search）适用于适应度函数（fitness function）可由机器核验的场景。ChatHTN (2025) 与 AlphaEvolve (2025) 展示了这两种方法与大语言模型（LLM）结合后各自能实现什么。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "281f632c2a11678111ea2272e6bbe990325ed5e61a939705986ce7b2f37393ca",
      "target": "**Type:** Build\n**Languages:** Python (stdlib)\n**Prerequisites:** 阶段 14 · 02（ReWOO 与 Plan-and-Execute）\n**Time:** ~75 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
