      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "584e52d24f2b17886a76212978741fa03ba6bc6aa292a0331b41402490b42267",
      "target": "## 学习目标\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "6b51d410a38b449c541a88f95c06ac168bac27aaaf307dd62496198ea26a9af1",
      "target": "- 解释分层任务网络（Hierarchical Task Networks，HTN）：任务（task）、方法（method）、规划算子（operator）、前置条件（precondition）与效果（effect）。\n- 说明 ChatHTN 的混合循环（hybrid loop）：符号搜索（symbolic search）结合 LLM 回退（LLM fallback）分解（decomposition）。\n- 解释 AlphaEvolve 的演化循环，以及为什么它必须有程序化评估器（programmatic evaluator）才能工作。\n- 仅用标准库（stdlib）实现两个简化示例（toy）：一个 HTN 规划器（planner）和一个演化搜索（evolutionary search）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "86cd1eab2128944bea08082e9c1406433fe3b5c9ab5cd89f0a707a32b7be3034",
      "target": "ReWOO（第 02 课）、Plan-and-Execute（规划后执行）和 ReAct 涵盖了大多数智能体（agent）规划场景。但它们有两类场景处理得不够好：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0015",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "5220110b9c55bf5836513977e91f0eb0c8ecbcfe6dfbf072c3ec4c7bc859f671",
      "target": "1. **正确性可证明的计划。** 调度（scheduling）、飞行路径规划（flight pathing）、合规工作流（compliance workflows）：计划必须在构造时就保证健全性（soundness）。LLM 给出的计划即使表达流畅，只要偶尔会凭空编造一个步骤，就不可接受。\n2. **适应度函数可由机器核验的优化问题。** 矩阵乘法（matrix multiplication）、调度启发式方法（scheduling heuristics）、编译器优化处理阶段（compiler passes）：目标不是“正确的计划”，而是“最好的计划”。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "354f74f440a4d859484bc330ba82adea63d22a92121798cfd84a30492fdfb6be",
      "target": "HTN 规划与 AlphaEvolve 解决的是两种不同的问题。两者都用 LLM 增强自身能力，而不是替代自身机制。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
