        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "cac4e636d46b29ae4ba5aa0c8f34d3e758840d7720db257e110484e31d12b204",
      "target": "### 分层任务网络\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "e0255c2b7d3fa78ff30c2ad3bdfac917e72dc882daddff895ed9adb66f848f79",
      "target": "HTN 包括：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0025",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "e864e468131c1ea7a29c0169878ffde8304b7a49c5f850a1bd89fcb8312b2ec8",
      "target": "- **任务**：复合任务（compound task，需要分解）与原始任务（primitive task，可直接执行）。\n- **方法**：将复合任务分解为子任务（subtask）的方式，带有前置条件。\n- **规划算子**：带有前置条件和效果的原始动作。\n- **状态（state）**：一组事实（fact）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "b7adc8dbd5bd55a50b68af294f6aed3eb87c8d6a24d2df474050963de5b9ac89",
      "target": "规划（planning）：给定目标任务（goal task）与初始状态（initial state），找到一种将其分解为原始规划算子（primitive operator）的方案，使各算子的前置条件按顺序得到满足。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "641506987b0173f5c8e9f6ac62e8c1b397cbcef11650186e7e360a29a51b6f25",
      "target": "HTN 的历史早于 LLM，至今仍是构建可证明正确的计划时的参照。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Hierarchical Task Networks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "2ddc931a99ff652c2dc899b6e97e4f957c58931eab3f5c34ffd041f6d1aa86e3",
      "target": "### ChatHTN（Gopalakrishnan 等，2025）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "d12e5522ba0c2e0b53963d4523fb544a57279f8cdb46715c1fc8ae2157d24502",
      "target": "ChatHTN（arXiv:2505.11814）将符号 HTN 与 LLM 查询交错进行：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0035",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "05458b62f9c8ed8e5b99f4c959e4b51ef534d5d640022b9862a92beefb23fb43",
      "target": "1. 尝试用现有方法分解当前复合任务。\n2. 如果没有适用的方法，就询问 LLM：“在状态 `s` 下，你会怎样分解 `task`？”\n3. 将 LLM 的响应转换为候选子任务。\n4. 根据规划算子的 schema（结构定义）进行校验，拒绝无效分解。\n5. 递归处理（recurse）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "0ed4c2e3d1e6f16f1ba77879eee62a08b8349aa9a6939527f1504906fb6cbdb5",
      "target": "论文的核心主张是：生成的每个计划都可证明具有健全性，因为 LLM 的建议只会作为候选分解进入流程，绝不会直接修改计划。符号层负责保证正确性；LLM 扩充方法库（method library）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "44cf6aab4d22522f1a407f0007bce0a056eedea12c4612015fd647589b0309f8",
      "target": "在线方法学习（online method learning，OpenReview `gwYEDY9j2x`，2025 年的后续研究）引入了一个学习器（learner），通过回归（regression）对 LLM 生成的分解进行泛化（generalize），将 LLM 查询频率最多降低 75%。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### ChatHTN (Gopalakrishnan et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
