      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "721cc508c65c6330192ae793f694ba94f80cacf131cdc6ea815e188cfd79b9a7",
      "target": "### AlphaEvolve（Novikov 等，2025）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### AlphaEvolve (Novikov et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### AlphaEvolve (Novikov et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "d67b3fc564bf3972fd49886f8ed2dbb1bdd5962b4418e94c6295cfe6202e91d0",
      "target": "AlphaEvolve（arXiv:2506.13131，DeepMind，June 2025）走的是另一条路线：由 Gemini 2.0 Flash/Pro 集成（ensemble）协调演化代码搜索。\n"
    },
    {
