      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0051",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### AlphaEvolve (Novikov et al., 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "c0897015649b69cba554906b89eabe0cf1bb27e6f5ec46439f6def44f02953f4",
      "target": "- 在 4x4 复数矩阵（complex matrix）乘法上，首次实现了 56 年来对 Strassen 方法的改进，仅需 48 次标量乘法（scalar multiplications）。\n- 通过一种 Borg 调度启发式方法，为 Google 收回了 0.7% 的算力。\n- 在一项前沿工作负载（frontier workload）上，让 FlashAttention 加速 32%。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
