      "source_sha256": "e1e8f05ce1e56336eee1aa34379aabeb68ba749243fb27d1be9cee00f0d09abe",
      "target": "### 何时选择哪一种\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### When to use which"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0057",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### When to use which"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "79017f249ffbcfd383534a6f712ff4cadec3c529da2a0239f92626a95c3f92ea",
      "target": "| 问题类别 | 采用的方法 | 原因 |\n|---------------|-----|-----|\n| 带有硬约束（hard constraints）的调度 | HTN + ChatHTN | 可证明的健全性 |\n| 编译器优化（compiler optimization） | AlphaEvolve | 可机器核验的适应度（machine-checkable fitness） |\n| 多步骤任务执行 | ReAct / ReWOO | LLM 参与循环，但没有形式化保证（formal guarantees） |\n| 以测试为依据改进代码 | AlphaEvolve | 测试就是评估器 |\n| 受规则约束的自动化（policy-bound automation） | HTN | 前置条件对规则进行编码 |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-11:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Planning with HTN and Evolutionary Search",
        "## The Concept",
        "### When to use which"
